# fixedbugs, defect 2364, lane p239-land-a, 2026-11-09 (panel 239's R4), the
# other walk: the module defining the macro is named so that it is walked
# after `rs`, and the unit reads `rs.h` first already. The two cases pin that
# the program means one thing whatever the modules are named; before the
# repair this one printed 9 and the other was refused.
use fixedbugs2364/rs
use fixedbugs2364/then_wide

function main()
    p = then_wide.make(v: 4)
    r = rs.make(v: 3)
    print(p.w + r.a + r.b)
